      "cooked": "<p>Hi all, I am trying to remove search bar from showing in desktop, how do I do it? Tried with custom app and js and css but nothing works.</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/e/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-02-18 at 19.35.56\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2_2_690x209.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-18 at 19.35.56\" data-base62-sha1=\"24MwIZnoLxMdgzJHyFhWbjxyu7E\" width=\"690\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2_2_690x209.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2_2_1035x313.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/e/0e8ec0551aacf85e9aae3124600448185a9bb1b2_2_1380x418.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B2128\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2026-02-18 at 19.35.56</span><span class=\"informations\">2040×618 27.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
