      "id": 494662,
      "username": "RocketQuack",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-02-19T13:36:19.644Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can disable the display of the search bar under a user in their settings.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a_2_690x289.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"nRZIMnCHAWPlXVsQX2dydbs6RN8\" width=\"690\" height=\"289\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a_2_690x289.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a74c8a0fb47d04c010290f2b1022d081f05d0d2a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">965×405 30.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In the sidebar, the whole thing works as intended, but there seems to be a visual bug at the moment so that the search field is still displayed in the desk.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/0/307702d12ab48cc45ffc63e7dd1efabcb2cdec44.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"6UJTHLpetDbD3Jqru1pZQ0xBuPa\" width=\"214\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p>However, the functionality behind it is disabled, so you can no longer click on it if you disable it in the settings.</p>",
